  "title": "Harness-Native and Multi-Agent Routing in AI: A Data Flywheel and Set-Valued Prediction Framework",
  "summary": "Harness-Native agentic routing optimizes execution state and data records, while multi-agent routing improves accuracy and cost efficiency through set-valued prediction. Both frameworks address challenges in human-robot interaction and contextual awareness.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "Harness-Native agentic routing selects either a single best-fit model or multiple complementary models for ensemble-style accuracy improvement, conditioned on the full harness state.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
